name krxn1 krxn2  (calibrated 2026-10-25 against IPCC 2019 rice CH4 (1.19 kg/ha/d): reference soil, 15-cell grid, reactions incl. g2o2, nh4up, rtoxy (root O2 loss 10 mmol/m2/d), --phd=14 --ch4ph=6.2:7.9:6.5 --nucl=cc:0.001 --kscale=maf:0.45,fsp:0.25; flooded 1.17 kg/ha/d). v5 (2026-10-25): N2O-reductase pH50 5.5 (was 6), keeping acid-soil (pH ~5) N2O at 2.3 kg N/ha/season vs 1.8 at pH 6.5; pH50 6 gave 15-28 kg N/ha at pH 5) v6 (2026-10-26): calibrated on the settled season+fallow cycle (paddy/multiyear/run_chain.sh, 3 yr after the fallow spin-up, OMF 0.7) with no methanogen pH response (no --ch4ph), --n2c=0.03 (straw/root inputs) and the Si feedback on root O2 loss --rtsi=5e-4:2.7e-4:0.5; g2ch4 vmax 950 (900 gave 128 kg CH4/ha/season at year 4) v7 (2026-10-26): as v6 plus O2 inhibition constant of all anaerobic pathways 2.5e-7 M (--o2inh=2.5e-7; was 2.52e-5, which left ~9% of anaerobic rates in aerated soil and gave ~7 kg N2O-N/ha in the fallow); g2ch4 vmax 1600 (1750 gave 151 kg CH4/ha/season) v8 (2026-10-26): same constants as v7 plus rice Si uptake (reaction siup, default 3.7 mol Si/m2/yr, Km 0.3 mM) and soil amorphous-silica rate x30 (--kscale=maf:0.45,fsp:0.25,amsi:30), giving porewater Si 0.19 mM and uptake 130 kg Si/ha/season without basalt; Si feedback w 0.5 (--rtsi=5e-4:2.7e-4:0.5, fits Gong -18% at w~0.53). Flooded 129 kg CH4/ha/season, AWD/flooded 0.71. Full production options: --o2inh=2.5e-7 --n2c=0.03 --rtsi=5e-4:2.7e-4:0.5 --kscale=maf:0.45,fsp:0.25,amsi:30 --nucl=cc:0.001, no --ch4ph, settled cycle via paddy/multiyear/run_chain.sh (3 yr, OMF 0.7), exe from makefile_paddy_fast v9 (2026-10-26): multi-year baseline without drift: percolation --q=0.1 (well-puddled paddy with a plough pan; at 0.5 m/yr Fe2+ leaching drains the plough layer's reducible Fe and control CH4 rises ~6%/yr, as in leaky 'akiochi' soils), puddling depth 0.2 m (run_chain.sh TILL=0.2), siderite oxidation (sidox), Fe(III) input --fe3in=0.3; g2ch4 vmax 2100 (1600/2400/3200 gave ~87/155/215 kg CH4/ha/season on the settled cycle). Production options: as v8 plus --q=0.1 --fe3in=0.3, TILL=0.2, exe scepter_paddy_v10 v9.1 (2026-10-26): g2n2p vmax 1000 (was 300): season N2O 0.40 kg N2O-N/ha with 120 kg urea-N and a pre-harvest drain (300 gave 1.7; Akiyama et al. 2005 flooded-rice EF 0.31% -> ~0.4 kg); CH4 unchanged
g2ch4 2100 30
g2fe3 300 -999
g2so4 300 -999
ch4pl 300 -999
g2n21 300 -999
g2n2p 1000 5.5
g2gr -999 0.3
rtco2 60 -999
amo2o 30 -999
